{"2215800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cold Killers", "steam_appid": 2215800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cold Killers is a multiplayer social deduction game with penguins! Face off against your friends in quick, thrilling matches filled with death &amp; deception.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Rockehopper Manor, the “Blue Ocean Event” is progressing without a hitch. Esteemed Penguins from all over the continent are here to drink and socialise. But some penguins are not here for the finger food. Spies have been sent to uncover what secrets the Event may hold, whilst assassins are sent to stop them, hiding in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Security Guards of the Manor must stop these Penguins from completing their objectives, and maintain peace at the Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will the Spies complete their objectives and flee with their lives or be stopped by the assassins or guards?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/19a386e6ccf9d4dc0c6965ad9ed7b3cd.avif?t=1785888109\" width=1560 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/6b74a6c60e4580e601d5dfdb8920303c.avif?t=1785888109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras_big/6b74a6c60e4580e601d5dfdb8920303c.webp?t=1785888109 width=1560 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hired gun sent to the event to hunt down the Secret Agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the masses, find the gun parts scattered throughout the many rooms of the Ballroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify who the Secret Agent is and take him out, before fleeing to win the round. Avoid the Guard however, any suspicion you raise can be used against you by the Secret Agent, so tread lightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/d60a4ffd526d40b912859400ecf25d21.avif?t=1785888109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras_big/d60a4ffd526d40b912859400ecf25d21.webp?t=1785888109 width=1560 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard Maintain Order as Assassins and Secret Agents run amok in your Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrest suspicious individuals by beating them down with your Baton, and handcuffing them to send them to the security room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent Assassins and Secret Agents from completing their tasks for the night to win the Round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/11b8c0e8260569edf0aa2cee3139d9ad.avif?t=1785888109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras_big/11b8c0e8260569edf0aa2cee3139d9ad.webp?t=1785888109 width=1560 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Secret Agent, you must use your skills to complete your list of objectives and ex-filtrate undetected to win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal Clues, Locate Informants, Bribe Staff, but don’t get caught by the Guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any trouble could lead to suspicion from potential enemies. Beware, among the sea of penguins at the event, an Assassin has been dispatched to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-5 Players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP, PvE &amp; Co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated penguins each match!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity-based Voice Chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Deduction with a slice of Interrogation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in with dinner party NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taunts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/feda5133c578532b7674e3aa003bb39d.avif?t=1785888109\" width=1560 height=412 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cold Killers is a multiplayer social deduction game with penguins! Face off against your friends in quick, thrilling matches filled with death &amp; deception.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Rockehopper Manor, the “Blue Ocean Event” is progressing without a hitch. Esteemed Penguins from all over the continent are here to drink and socialise. But some penguins are not here for the finger food. Spies have been sent to uncover what secrets the Event may hold, whilst assassins are sent to stop them, hiding in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Security Guards of the Manor must stop these Penguins from completing their objectives, and maintain peace at the Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will the Spies complete their objectives and flee with their lives or be stopped by the assassins or guards?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/19a386e6ccf9d4dc0c6965ad9ed7b3cd.avif?t=1785888109\" width=1560 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/6b74a6c60e4580e601d5dfdb8920303c.avif?t=1785888109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras_big/6b74a6c60e4580e601d5dfdb8920303c.webp?t=1785888109 width=1560 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hired gun sent to the event to hunt down the Secret Agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the masses, find the gun parts scattered throughout the many rooms of the Ballroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify who the Secret Agent is and take him out, before fleeing to win the round. Avoid the Guard however, any suspicion you raise can be used against you by the Secret Agent, so tread lightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/d60a4ffd526d40b912859400ecf25d21.avif?t=1785888109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras_big/d60a4ffd526d40b912859400ecf25d21.webp?t=1785888109 width=1560 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard Maintain Order as Assassins and Secret Agents run amok in your Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrest suspicious individuals by beating them down with your Baton, and handcuffing them to send them to the security room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent Assassins and Secret Agents from completing their tasks for the night to win the Round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/11b8c0e8260569edf0aa2cee3139d9ad.avif?t=1785888109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras_big/11b8c0e8260569edf0aa2cee3139d9ad.webp?t=1785888109 width=1560 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Secret Agent, you must use your skills to complete your list of objectives and ex-filtrate undetected to win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal Clues, Locate Informants, Bribe Staff, but don’t get caught by the Guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any trouble could lead to suspicion from potential enemies. Beware, among the sea of penguins at the event, an Assassin has been dispatched to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-5 Players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP, PvE &amp; Co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated penguins each match!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity-based Voice Chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Deduction with a slice of Interrogation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in with dinner party NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taunts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215800/extras/feda5133c578532b7674e3aa003bb39d.avif?t=1785888109\" width=1560 height=412 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A Secret Agent, an Assassin &amp; 2 guards trying to keep things cool. Cold Killers is a co-op espionage game set during a dinner party at the bottom of the world. Steal clues, blend-in to crowds, hunt your penguin or interrogate guests, each role pits you against the others. Who will come out on top?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://